g","line":30,"embedded":true},{"title":"`MKStandardMapConfiguration.EmphasisStyle`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MKStandardMapConfiguration/EmphasisStyle-swift.enum","line":34},{"title":"A screenshot of a single pin with the number three, representing a cluster of three points of interest that are within close proximity.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/26a4541efb07044a1fa8f7a06cd0551c/maps-points-of-interest-cluster%402x.png","line":42,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of three orange pins when zoomed in, representing three individual points of interest.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/bb8de6a531cbd567d480addff18221ee/maps-points-of-interest-individual%402x.png","line":44,"embedded":true},{"title":"Custom information","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/maps#Custom-information","line":61},{"title":"`MKAnnotationView`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MKAnnotationView","line":63},{"title":"`MKMapFeatureOptions`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MKMapFeatureOptions","line":65},{"title":"Displaying overlays on a map","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/displaying-overlays-on-a-map","line":76},{"title":"`MKOverlayLevel`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MKOverlayLevel","line":76},{"title":"Place cards","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/maps#Place-cards","line":80},{"title":"Displaying place cards in a map","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/maps#Displaying-place-cards-in-a-map","line":84},{"title":"`mapItemDetailSelectionAccessory(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MapContent/mapItemDetailSelectionAccessory\\(_:\\","line":86},{"title":"`mapView(_:selectionAccessoryFor:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MKMapViewDelegate/mapView\\(_:selectionAccessoryFor:\\","line":86},{"title":"`selectionAccessory`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKitJS/Annotation/selectionAccessory","line":86},{"title":"`mapView(_:selectionAccessoryFor:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MKMapViewDelegate/mapView\\(_:selectionAccessoryFor:\\","line":88},{"title":"`selectableMapFeatureSelectionAccessory`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKitJS/Map/selectableMapFeatureSelectionAccessory","line":88},{"title":"`mapFeatureSelectionAccessory(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/View/mapFeatureSelectionAccessory\\(_:\\","line":88},{"title":"Displaying place information using the Maps Embed API","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKitJS/displaying-place-information-using-the-maps-embed-api","line":92},{"title":"sheet","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sheets","line":102},{"title":"`MapItemDetailSelectionAccessoryStyle`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MapItemDetailSelectionAccessoryStyle","line":107},{"title":"`MKSelectionAccessory.MapItemDetailPresentationStyle`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MKSelectionAccessory/MapItemDetailPresentationStyle","line":107},{"title":"`PlaceSelectionAccessoryStyle`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKitJS/PlaceSelectionAccessoryStyle","line":107},{"title":"A screenshot of the full callout style place card in a map on iPad. The top of the place card contains a header image and the place name, category, and rating. The place card also includes a tile with operating hours; a tile with the website, phone number, and address; and a tile with an 'Open in Apple Maps' link.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/7b978f0c16b84311c4d3f9f35d9c0fb4/maps-place-card-ipad-full%402x.png","line":116,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the compact callout style place card in a map on iPad. The place card includes the place name, category, shortened address, rating, and 'Open in Apple Maps' link.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ad7dc822fa480dfe3b4fa5d344536518/maps-place-card-ipad-compact%402x.png","line":118,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the caption style place card in a map on iPad. The place card contains an 'Open in Apple Maps' link.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/f200b2f25897fefc55d30b6c5b6258c5/maps-place-card-ipad-link%402x.png","line":120,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the sheet style place card in a map on iPad, which appears on top of the map view. The top of the place card contains a header image and the place name, category, and rating. The place card also includes a tile with operating hours; a tile with the website, phone number, and address; and a tile with an 'Open in Apple Maps' link.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d5b8b635c902d62449c481531152bae9/maps-place-card-ipad-sheet%402x.png","line":122,"embedded":true},{"title":"sheet","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sheets","line":124},{"title":"A screenshot of the full callout style place card in a map on iPhone. The place card appears as a sheet from the bottom edge of the device.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6499250814a43a161484e99968aa503c/maps-place-card-iphone-full%402x.png","line":126,"embedded":true},{"title":"`accessoryOffset`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MKAnnotationView/accessoryOffset","line":134},{"title":"`selectionAccessoryOffset`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKitJS/Annotation/selectionAccessoryOffset","line":134},{"title":"`offset(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/View/offset\\(_:\\","line":134},{"title":"Adding place cards outside of a map","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/maps#Adding-place-cards-outside-of-a-map","line":136},{"title":"`mapItemDetailSelectionAccessory(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MapContent/mapItemDetailSelectionAccessory\\(_:\\","line":138},{"title":"`mapItemDetail(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MKSelectionAccessory/mapItemDetail\\(_:\\","line":138},{"title":"`PlaceDetail`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKitJS/PlaceDetail","line":138},{"title":"`init(mapItem:displaysMap:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/MapKit/MKMapItemDetailViewController/init\\(mapItem:displaysMap:\\","line":142},{"title":"`mapItemDetailSheet(item:displaysMap:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/View/mapItemDetailSheet\\(item:displaysMap:\\","line":142},{"title":"Indoor maps","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/maps#Indoor-maps","line":146},{"title":"A screenshot of a map on iPhone, displaying the San Jose International airport and the surrounding area. A card in the bottom half of the screen displays information and options, including the airport name and buttons for sharing, closing the card, navigating to the airport, calling the airport, visiting the airport's website, and more.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/669a55f1fc7dd419351d60b4decfbbf5/indoor-maps-example1%402x.png","line":156,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of a map on iPhone, displaying Terminal B at the San Jose International airport. Gate numbers are displayed above the terminal on the map. A minimized card containing information and options for the airport is visible at the bottom of the screen.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/bd86841c0079e56b609826b4b97c24aa/indoor-maps-example2%402x.png","line":158,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of a map on iPhone, displaying a close-up view of a terminal at the San Jose International airport. A security checkpoint, first aid stations, restrooms, an escalator, and a gate number are displayed on the map. A minimized card containing a search field and a Browse SJC button is visible at the bottom of the screen.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b36b5ea10535fbb6b42f3ca319bba1e7/indoor-maps-example3%402x.png","line":160,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of a map on iPhone, zoomed in to show the location of an elevator in San Jose International airport. A minimized card containing information about the elevator is visible at the bottom of the screen.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b4dc405bf622e949194d8b8e4394ef9f/indoor-maps-elevator%402x.png","line":164,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of a map on iPhone, zoomed in to show the numbers and locations of some gates in a terminal at San Jose International airport. Other areas, including parking structures, are displayed without details. A minimized card containing a search field and a Browse SJC button is visible at the bottom of the screen.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/222bc580a24623284ceb5a388d31521a/indoor-maps-surroundings%402x.png","line":172,"embedded":true},{"title":"Indoor Mapping Data Format","target":"https://register.apple.com/resources/imdf/","line":178},{"title":"A screenshot of a custom map in an app on iPhone, showing an airport concourse. Elements of the map are tinted green to correspond with the app's UI, and custom icons represent gates, security checkpoints, and an information booth.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d87fb8004dcbd26d042a43ef797a1022/indoor-maps-custom-map-design%402x.png","line":180,"embedded":true},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/maps#Platform-considerations","line":182},{"title":"watchOS","target":"https://developer.apple.c